    done: `the cause of the lost colours named with the evidence (the registry dump before and after the switch) and fixed at the exe's behaviour (each change with its exe function and address, or a CAT-FIX / HWI-FIX stated); the team-colour self-test PASS at Mission02 and at the level after an NIS level with the user's non-default scheme (nPalettes > 0, the Kuun-Lan's and the Acolyte's palette index the player's scheme, the colour info the player's colours); the Mission02 PPM region on the Kuun-Lan following the player's base colour (and Mission01's before the warp); the headless Mission01 pair IDENTICAL in every field to the baseline; every other stream run IDENTICAL to producer 1's audited or R10's, or moved in rng_all only with a stated render-side reason; the loadgame pair; fe ASan 0; sp --timeout 1200 ASan 0 with the live colour-info blocks at Mission09 stated`,
